			<div id="about" class="inner-page-ttl-wrp uk-flex uk-flex-center uk-flex-middle uk-margin-large-bottom"
				style="background: url('/site/templates/assets/images/banner-3.png')no-repeat bottom center;background-size: 100%;">
				<h1 class="ttl fw-b cl-w uk-text-uppercase">
					ABOUT US				</h1>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-container uk-margin-large-bottom">
				<h2
					class="sec-ttl-3 uk-text-center uk-position-relative fz-26 cl-blu fw-b uk-margin-small-bottom uk-text-capitalize">
					<div class="ttl fz-26">
						The Finolex Way					</div>
					<span></span>
				</h2>
				<div class="fz-18 cl-5 fw-l uk-text-center uk-margin-large-bottom">
					<p>Once our customers install our pipes, they completely forget about us. We take great pride in this dependable quality that gives farmers, plumbers and home owners one less thing to worry about. This quality focus is not just restricted to our products, but defines every aspect of our functioning. Whether quality support for our dealers, vendors and suppliers. Quality opportunities to our employees. Superior quality of life, education and health of the people we serve through our various social responsibility initiatives.</p>				</div>
				<!--div class="uk-grid uk-margin-medium-bottom">
										<div class="uk-width-1-2@s bg-w uk-margin-medium-bottom">
							<div class="vm-box uk-flex uk-flex-top">
								<img src="" class="uk-flex-none" alt="">
								<div class="uk-margin-small-left">
									<h3 class="sec-ttl-4 fz-26 uk-position-relative cl-blu uk-margin-remove-top  fw-b uk-text-capitalize">We are in the business of</h3>
									<div class="fz-18 fw-n cl-5 uk-margin-bottom"><p>manufacturing high-quality PVC pipes and fittings. Serving as the life-supporting circulatory system for water and waste, across India – flowing in and out of farms and fields, industries, homes and cities. We do this with integrity, personal accountability, and by putting relationships above all else.</p></div>
									<!--a href="" class="read-more fz-18 cl-5 fw-b uk-text-capitalize uk-flex-inline uk-flex-center uk-flex-middle">
										read more
									</a>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>						<div class="uk-width-1-2@s bg-w uk-margin-medium-bottom">
							<div class="vm-box uk-flex uk-flex-top">
								<img src="" class="uk-flex-none" alt="">
								<div class="uk-margin-small-left">
									<h3 class="sec-ttl-4 fz-26 uk-position-relative cl-blu uk-margin-remove-top  fw-b uk-text-capitalize">Our core drivers</h3>
									<div class="fz-18 fw-n cl-5 uk-margin-bottom"><p>is to support and transform lives. Of our customers, end-users, stakeholders, employees, and the under-privileged. Positively transforming every human, material, and environment we engage with. Creating a legacy that inspires, and unites.</p></div>
									<!--a href="" class="read-more fz-18 cl-5 fw-b uk-text-capitalize uk-flex-inline uk-flex-center uk-flex-middle">
										read more
									</a>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

			</div-->
			</div>

			<section class="why-finolex uk-margin-large-bottom">
				<div class="cs-container">
					<h2
						class="sec-ttl-3 uk-text-center uk-position-relative fz-26 cl-blu fw-b uk-margin-small-bottom uk-text-capitalize">
						<div class="ttl fz-26">
							Fundamentally Finolex						</div>
						<span></span>
					</h2>
					<div class="fz-18 cl-5 fw-l uk-text-center">
						<p>To stay focused on making superior quality pipes and fittings, and nothing else but that, for forty years, is no mean feat. Aligning every decision, every action, every resource towards delivering quality pipes and fittings. To choose to do just one thing, and do it well. So that our customers can continue to rely on the pipes they laid down years ago. Now, that’s Finolex.</p>

<p>Our focus is single-minded. When we choose to diversify, it’s upstream with an open sea jetty to manage our raw materials, and downstream into last mile fulfilment. When we evolve, it has to be in our understanding of customer expectations and finding better machines and processes to meet those expectations. When we choose to expand, it is into newer markets, delivering our pipes and fittings to newer customers. And when we measure our growth, it is in reputation. The effect of which reflects in our bottom line - growing manifold in the last decade.</p>

<p>Over the last forty years, we have steadily added depth to our company, instead of spreading ourselves wide and thin. Consistently delivering the exact same products that fulfil the exact same promise. Every time. That’s what makes us a strong brand, with a strong network, and even stronger goodwill. That’s what makes us Finolex.</p>					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section id="founder" class="out-team uk-margin-large-bottom">
				<div class="cs-container">
					<h2
						class="sec-ttl-3 uk-text-center uk-position-relative fz-26 cl-blu fw-b uk-margin-large-bottom uk-text-capitalize">
						<div class="ttl">Our founder</div>
						<span></span>
					</h2>

					<div class="uk-flex founder-txt-wrp uk-flex-top">
						<img src="/site/templates/assets/images/founder.png"
							class="uk-flex-none founder-img uk-margin-bottom" alt="Late Shri Pralhad P. Chhabria">
						<div class="founder-right">
							<h3 class="fz-32 fw-b cl-blu uk-margin-remove founder-ttl">Late Shri Pralhad P. Chhabria</h3>
							<div class="fz-18 fw-n cl-0 uk-margin-medium-bottom">12th March 1930 - 5th May 2016</div>
							<div class="uk-margin-medium-bottom quote-txt">
								<div class="fz-22 cl-60 fw-b lh-2">Finolex Group was established in 1958 by Late Shri Pralhad P. Chhabria. He built the organisation on the belief that true success is found with “quality in mind and sincerity in heart”.
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="fw-18 cl-0 fw-b">
							
								Today, we continue to uphold the foundation he left behind. His legacy of discipline, technical precision, and commitment to world-class manufacturing remains the benchmark for every product that carries the Finolex name.

							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

				</div>
			</section>


